# This repository intentionally publishes only the Unity AI Log Analyzer subset.
*

# Repository metadata
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Unity Editor extension and documentation
!Assets/
Assets/*
!Assets/Editor/
Assets/Editor/*
!Assets/Editor/AILog*.cs
!Assets/Editor/AILog*.cs.meta
!Assets/Docs/
Assets/Docs/*
!Assets/Docs/AILogAnalyzer_*.md
!Assets/Docs/AILogAnalyzer_*.md.meta

# Python FastAPI server
!Tools/
Tools/*
!Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/
!Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/**

# Local Python and secret files must never be published.
Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/.env
Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/.env.*
!Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/.env.example
Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/.venv/
Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/**/__pycache__/
Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/.pytest_cache/
Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/.coverage
Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/htmlcov/
Tools/AILogAnalyzerServer/**/*.py[cod]

# Local editor and test artifacts
.vscode/
.vs/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
*.log
TestResults*.xml
